        "TileImage": "$($repository 3435d6ab-9534-42db-aab6-39f37d2a9095).Image",
        "Description": "A man named Kennedy has come to us this Friday.\r\rHe has a few guards and a few food vendors that he has been &quot;perplexed by&quot; (whatever that means). We are confused about why he feels he&apos;s been perplexed by these individuals, but we are definitely not confused about the the pay.\r\rHe is offering a large sum for the completion of this contract. I know you are the best and that by Shenanigans we&apos;ll have that money in our pockets.\r\rHappy Friday and good luck!",
